,{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为字母表。候选六元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>；结构定义后的输出子句固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)\\)</span> 属于对应机类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q,w\\in\\Sigma^*,a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(q\\in Q,w\\in\\Sigma^*,a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>；词运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0\\;[M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\land\\lambda:Q\\to\\Delta]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0\\;[M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\land\\lambda:Q\\to\\Delta]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0\\;[M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\land\\lambda:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to\\Delta]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0\\;[M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\land\\lambda:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to\\Delta]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\delta^*(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq q,\\qquad\\delta^*(q,wa)\\coloneqq\\delta(\\delta^*(q,w),a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\delta^*(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq q,\\qquad\\delta^*(q,wa)\\coloneqq\\delta(\\delta^*(q,w),a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\nT^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\langle\\lambda(q_0)\\rangle,\\qquad T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(wa)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)\\langle\\lambda(\\delta^*(q_0,wa))\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\nT^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\langle\\lambda(q_0)\\rangle,\\qquad T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(wa)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)\\langle\\lambda(\\delta^*(q_0,wa))\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\nT^{\\mathsf{Me}}_M(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_M(wa)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_M(w)\\langle\\lambda(\\delta^*(q_0,w),a)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\nT^{\\mathsf{Me}}_M(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_M(wa)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_M(w)\\langle\\lambda(\\delta^*(q_0,w),a)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>Moore 的输出由所到状态给出，含初始状态的输出，所以长度为输入长度加一；Mealy 每个输入字符产生一个输出。两套递归仅在各自已声明的机器类型上实例化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表。候选六元组 $M$；结构定义后的输出子句固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)$ 属于对应机类。$q\\in Q,w\\in\\Sigma^*,a\\in\\Sigma$；词运算见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Delta,\\delta,\\lambda,q_0)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q,w\\in\\Sigma^*,a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}machines}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\e